Window Function
1. Certain functions like finding out the second highest salary for each department is not possible and also all the colums are not viewed using the group by
hence, we make use of the window function.
2. Window function we make use of the functions like over() -> to create the window. row_number() for giving each row a number, partition by divides big window into individual
windows making use of partitionby.
3. rank() is used to rank the rows, for suppose if we partition by department and sort based on the salary, if there are duplicate salaries then row number will be unique,
rank will assign the number based on the ranke i.e.( row number salary1=salary2 the salary -1, salary-2, rank-> salary1=salary2 the salary1row =1, salary2row=1, but skips number 2
and gives number 3. Dense rank will solve this problem.
